'굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강신청자 추천 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 5. 8.(화)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수학 허가통보 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 2012. 5. 15(화)이전</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 지원자격 : 우리대학교와 학생교류 및 학점상호인정협정이 체결된&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학의 재학생으로 소속 대학 총장 추천을 받은 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2. 개설교과목시간표 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 붙임 참고</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">(홈페이지</span><a href=\"http://www.sunchon.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><u><font color=\"#800080\">www.sunchon.ac.kr</font></u></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #800080; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> /향림광장/알림마당/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">학사공지사항)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">3. 수강신청 학점 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">과목 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">학점 이내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">4. 수강료 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">학점당</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">35,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">원(실험？실습？실기교과목은 학점당 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">40,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">원)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">5. 수강신청 절차</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">1차</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 5.17(목) 10:00 ~&nbsp; 5. 21.(월) 17:00</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2차</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 5.29(화) 10:00 ~&nbsp; 5. 30.(수) 17:00&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나 장 소 :우리대학 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">Web상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">으로 신</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;(학번 : 우리대학 부여 학번,&nbsp; 초기비밀번호-주민번호 뒷자리)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">다. 유의 사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2차</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 수강 신청한 교과목은 취소 또는 변경이 일체 불허되며, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">수강신청 인원이 20명 미만 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">교과목은 폐강</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">하고</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">, 그 결과를 우리대학 홈페이지에 공고.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">6. 등록 기간 : 2012.6. 7.(목) ~ 6. 11.(월) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">은행마감시간까지(16:00)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강료 납부 장소 및 방법 : 농협 및 단위농협 전국지점(타은행 납부불가) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">☞</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 가상계좌 : 고지서에 기재된 가상계좌로 납부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수납은행 창구, 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹, CD/ATM 이용 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수납은행이 아닌 타은행 이용시 송금수수료는 본인 부담 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 등록금 고지서 출력 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;순천대학교 홈페이지- 종합정보시스템 - 로그인 - 학사정보관리시스템 - 등록관리에서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">개별 출력</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">7. 교과목 폐강 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">등록인원이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">명 미만일 경우 폐강</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">8. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">수강료 환불 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 폐강(등록인원 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">명 </span>http://hit.sunchon.ac.kr/login.html<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">미만)된 교과목에 한하여 학생 개인계좌로 송금</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강료는 원칙적으로 반환하지 않는다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">9. 취득학점 처리</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">학생이 취득한 학점은 우리대학교 학칙, 교학규정, 학생교류 및 학점인정에 관한 규정에 따라 처리함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 총 수업 시수의 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">4분의3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 이상을 출석하여야 성적을 취득할 수 있음.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">10. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 선수과목이 필요한 과목을 신청할 경우 선수과목 이수여부를 확인한 후 신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 8학기차(건축학 10학기차) 재학생 및 2012-1학기 타대학 편입학 에정자는 타대학</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;수학신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목이 확점은 인정하지 않음.(재수강 불가)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">※ 붙임파일 : 타대학수학신청원 서식</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
